<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="2CO" style="id">2KO Itsaangi (TSA)</book>
  <para style="h">2 Koliito</para>
  <para style="toc1">Muhanda a myole wa Pahuli huli bisu Koliito</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 Koliito</para>
  <para style="toc3">2Ko</para>
  <para style="mt2">Muhanda a myole wa Pahuli huli bisu Koliito</para>
  <para style="mt1">KOLIITO</para>
  <para style="imt">Kotili</para>
  <para style="ip">Umata muhanda a tsomi wa Pahuli, nde ayuhi matsaangu ma maamati tsyelo na tsyelo hu Koliito (utala mu <char style="xt"><ref loc="2CO 2:3">2.3</ref></char>). Itwadi hya Pahuli na libundu hyaafulili ubiiya. Teehele Pahuli abweyene yene la moole hu Koliito, nde afwana usonehe muhanda mu usobo matsimi mo maana.</para>
  <para style="ip">Mu mabuli ma <char style="xt"><ref loc="2CO 1-7">1–7</ref></char>, Pahuli li mu ukalana mbiili a nde, nde wu abeedi iluumbi hya mbuli hya Yisu Kristo. Huli nde, hyo hili isalu. Biita la nde limosi, ndulu ni uyaabisa Nzambi Taata na Yisu Kristo mu mambuha moosi. Mu isalu hi nde haayaki, hu li na mapasi, na makwamisa, na mabaku ma malahi. Nde ubaakuunda mo na mukonono. Ni mu buuna, Pahuli ali mu utsima usobo matsimi ma bisu Koliito, baveletiimba tso nde mwakulu, tso ndongisili yi nde haviidi bo.</para>
  <para style="ip">Mu mabuli ma <char style="xt"><ref loc="2CO 8-9">8–9</ref></char>, Pahuli li mu uvondo huli Bamukristo ba hu Koliito, mu ukabila na mutima wu ayaluha, huli Bamukristo ba hu Yeruselemi ba bali biyaha. Bamosi ba bali na busina bu bwaafulala, baafwana uva huli ba baavele na isiha. Mu taangu yi Pahuli ali mu usonehe muhanda mo wunuuwu, Koliito li musyenge nga busina. Mumbungu aba asinzasyenoho, na mbahili a mbongo yabeedi na tsoongo yindahi. Mabuli mo maniima, mali mu udyengese matsimi mu itwadi. Yisu Kristo wu abeedi isina, akituhi iyaha, mana mu buyaha bwa nde, baatu bakituha bisina (<char style="xt"><ref loc="2CO 8:9">8.9</ref></char>). Liina ni li libaapfuuta itwadi hya baatu.</para>
  <para style="ip">Mu mabuli ma <char style="xt"><ref loc="2CO 10-13">10–13</ref></char>, Pahuli li mu umweese mambiili ma maaveleyelemene na biluumbi bya Yisu Kristo. Libundu la Koliito lili mu uyungasa baatu ba bali mu uyaabisa musamu wu asobohono na wa Pahuli (<char style="xt"><ref loc="2CO 11:3-4">11.3-4</ref></char>). Binama bi libundu, byamiisiinga mbiili yi baatu mo baana bali mu umweese bo. Bo bali mu umonehele we biluumbi bi binene, na bali mu uyambila mu mikuma mya soho. Bo bali na muyusu na bali mu usilasa bo mwakulu mu mbiingili a bo. Liina laayelemene na ifwaani hya taangu yoosi mu mbiili a bisu Koliito.</para>
  <para style="ip">Pahuli li mu umweese ifwaani ikima hi iluumbi. Iluumbi hya Yisu Kristo, hili mu umonehele hi hyakulamana, mana nde asyenolo bakima. Nde afwana usiinga uba wu akolo, mu tooni ati nde li mu ukeele uyaka mifudi huli Nzambi. Nde a huuvondo pasi isiha mu tooni a nde mwakulu ve, tso muyusu, tso busina. Pahuli li mu uyibuhala moonyi ti, nde ayabisi Musamu wu Mubwe mu bungodu huli Bakoliito, hwaavele uvondo bo mbongo. Buuna ni mu uleele ti, litondo la Nzambi mu baatu lili li bungodu. Nzambi a habaavondo pasi isiha mu ikiisa ve.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2CO 1" />
  <para style="s">Mabwehe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 1:1" />Ni me Pahuli, wu li iluumbi hya Yisu Kristo wu Nzambi hasoolo, itwadi na mwana a ngu a bisu Timoteho, ndi mu utsonehe muhanda mo wunuuwu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CO 1:1">Huli libundu la Nzambi li lili hu musyenge a Koliito, na huli bangidi ba Nzambi boosi ba bali hu itaanzi hya Akayi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.1 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Akayi </char><char style="ft" closed="false">itaanzi hya bisu Looma, hi hyayelemene na ibadi hya hu baanda a Ngerese ya lolo yiniiyi.</char></note> yi tiindala: <verse eid="2CO 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 1:2" />Nyaha Nzambi Taata a bisu na Pfumu Yisu Kristo, bava benu hyese na hyenze.<verse eid="2CO 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Pahuli miifutala matondo huli Nzambi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 1:3" />Liyuusaani Nzambi, Taata a Pfumu a bisu Yisu Kristo, Taata nga a kwili lingebe, Nzambi wu ubaahwadisa baatu mu mataangu moosi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.3 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">ubaahwadisa baatu mu mataangu moosi </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ufwanisa na </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 40:1">Esa 40.1</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 94:19">Mkg 94.19</ref></char>.</note>! <verse eid="2CO 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 1:4" />Nde ubaahwadisa bisu mu mapasi ma bisu moosi. Ni mu buuna, bisu kaka luutwala uhwadisa ba bali mu umono mapasi ma pila mu pila, mu ubehele bo kwadisili yi bisu mwakulu laayaki huli Nzambi. <verse eid="2CO 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 1:5" />Mu mbuli, we bu mapasi ma Kristo maalutahala mu bisu, ni bumosi kaka kwadisili a bisu yaalutahala bunene mu Kristo. <verse eid="2CO 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 1:6" />Tso bisu laamiikeehele, ni mu tooni a kwadisili a benu na liyobolo la benu. Tso baahwadisi bisu, ni mu tooni a kwadisili a benu, mana benu liba na mifudi mi ukuunda na mukonono mapasi ni mamosi ma bisu lili mu ukuunda. <verse eid="2CO 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 1:7" />Ni mu buuna, hiitu hya bisu mu benu hili hi hyaavangama, mu tooni ati, bisu liyaabi: we bu benu libaakaba mapasi na bisu, benu libaakaba kaka kwadisili na bisu.<verse eid="2CO 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 1:8" />Mu mbuli, baana ba ngu, bisu litondi ti benu liyaaba ti mapasi ma bisu laamoni hu itaanzi hya Asiya<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.8 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">itaanzi hya Asiya </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hyo aba itaanzi hya bisu Looma hi musyenge a tsomi haaba Efeso. Fwanisa na </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="1CO 15:32">1Ko 15.32</ref></char>.</note>, aba maafulala mifudi myuveletwala ukuunda. Naapa hiitu hi uba moonyi, aba hyamiifwa. <verse eid="2CO 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 1:9" />Ka bisu laakamono ti baaviidi bisu kesili yi lipfu. Ka bwavangimi buuna, mana bisu libaavelesa hiitu mu bisu mwakulu, ka ndulu mu Nzambi wu ubaafutala babaakwa hu moonyi. <verse eid="2CO 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 1:10" />Nde ni wu afuuhasa bisu mu lipfu la pila yiina, na ni nde ubwefuuhasa bisu mu lo. Eeye, bisu lili na hiitu mu nde ti, nde ubwefuuhasa bisu, <verse eid="2CO 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 1:11" />na benu mwakulu luukaasala itwadi na bisu, mu ubaasambila mu bisu. Buuna, Nzambi uyuhala masambulu ma baatu ba balahi buukaasa mu bisu. Nde uva bisu hyese mo hiina, na baatu ba balahi buufutala matondo huli Nzambi mu tooni a bisu.<verse eid="2CO 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Pahuli miisobo makani ma midyenge mya nde</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 1:12" />Mono mu ki dyambu bisu luutwala uba na nyeme: we bu matsimi ma bisu mali mu uta imbangi, mbiili a bisu ŋa busu bwa baatu ba tsi, homo ŋa busu bwa benu, aba yi bulembo, na yi imbuli bi bibaamata huli Nzambi. Ni hyese hya Nzambi hyaakasuungaha bisu, ka a tsiki a imuutu ve. <verse eid="2CO 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 1:13" />Eeye, mu mihanda mya bisu, bisu lili mu usonehele benu ndulu mambu ma benu lili mu utaanga muuna na utsikaha. Me na hiitu ti, mu mataangu ma muuya, benu luutsikaha mo bu hwafwana. <verse eid="2CO 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 1:14" />Ka natee bunuubu, benu laamiitsikaha ndulu hoole. Mu ilumbu hya nziili a Yisu, Pfumu a bisu, benu luusinzatsikaha na luuba na nyeme mu bisu, we bu bisu luuba na nyeme mu benu.<verse eid="2CO 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 1:15" />Me ambeedi na hiitu mu mambu mo maana. Ni mu buuna, me akiimaapyohele huli benu, mu uva benu lisyeme la moole. <verse eid="2CO 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 1:16" />Mu mbuli, me akatsima uvyohele huli benu, titswene uyene hu Masedonya, na ubwemono benu ŋa me unzaapfutaha. Mu tooni ati, hwakiifwana ti benu likumbasa me mu usupala mudyenge a me hu tsyelo a Yude. <verse eid="2CO 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 1:17" />Ŋa me akuti kani mo yiina, kaahu me amonihili muutu wu aleenge? Be makesili ma me umbaapolo, kaahu ma baatu banga mapfuta, ba bubaaleele «eeye» na «naana» nzila mosi? <verse eid="2CO 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 1:18" />Nzambi li mbangi a me, na maambu ma bisu laaleeli benu, a mali «eeye» na «naana» nzila mosi ve. <verse eid="2CO 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CO 1:19" />Yisu Kristo, Mwana a Nzambi wu Silaasi, na Timoteho na me mwakulu<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 18:5">Mav 18.5</ref></char></note> laayabisi benu, a haayidi mu uleele «eeye» na «naana» nzila mosi ve. Mu tooni ati mu nde, hu li ndulu «eeye». <verse eid="2CO 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CO 1:20" />Mu mbuli, nde ni «eeye» yi yili mu usilasa malahi ma Nzambi moosi. Buuna, ni mu Yisu Kristo, bisu libaaleele «amen<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.20 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">amen </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ikuma mo hiniihi mbindulili ni ti «nyaha buba buuna» mu usilasa tsukusu lisambulu ŋa muutu amiimana usambila hu mbisa a hu nde amiileele «ameni».</char></note>», ni «eeye» a bisu, mu uva muyusu huli Nzambi. <verse eid="2CO 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CO 1:21" />Na ni Nzambi nde mwakulu ubaahwadisa bisu a benu, mu idiingu hya na Kristo. Nde mwakulu ni wu asoolo bisu, <verse eid="2CO 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CO 1:22" />nde akumi bisu iliimbu hya nduhi a nde, na nde ayitili Livupu la Ngidi mu mitima mya bisu, we tsuha yi nde haamiisa bisu lahi.<verse eid="2CO 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CO 1:23" />Nzambi li mbangi a me. Tso a buuna ve, nde amaasa muvumu a me, tso me ndi mu upfuta. Me a hambwenzafutahala hu musyenge a Koliito ve, mana benu livelemono pasi. <verse eid="2CO 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CO 1:24" />Bisu a lili mu ukwamisa benu mu usiinga mbiili a bisu yoosi na matsimi ma bisu mu dyambu li usa imiinu mu Yisu ve. Mu tooni ati, benu laahwada mu imiinu. Tso bisu a benu lisali itwadi, ni mu libwe la benu bisu boosi libaasala.<verse eid="2CO 1:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="2CO 2" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 2:1" />Ni mu buuna, me apoli kesili yi ubweveleyafutahala huli benu, mu uvelenyongese benu. <verse eid="2CO 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 2:2" />Mu tooni ati, tso me nyongisi benu, na ubwemweese me kinya? Baatu ba me anyongisi, utwala ubwemweese me kinya ve! <verse eid="2CO 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 2:3" />Ni mu buuna, tso me atsonehele benu mambu mo maana, ni mu tooni ati, ŋa me unza huli benu, me pelenyongo mu baatu ba bakiimweese me kinya. Mu mbuli, me ndi na hiitu ti kinya a me, ni ya benu boosi kaka. <verse eid="2CO 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 2:4" />Eeye, me atsonehele benu hutso mapasi ma manene, mutima wu aleme, na matsanga ma malahi. A ni mu unyongese benu ve, ka mana benu liyaaba ki pila litondo me ndi na lo mu benu.<verse eid="2CO 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Usa kolo-kolo huli muutu nga a tooni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 2:5" />Tso muutu li tooni a nyongisili, a mu me ve, ka ni mu benu boosi nde ali tooni a nyongisili. Buuve, mu uvelelutasala iteesi, ni buli la baatu ba baafulala ŋa hati la benu nde huunyongese. <verse eid="2CO 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 2:6" />Hufwani huli muutu wa pila yiina ti, baatu ba balahi bafwengele nde. <verse eid="2CO 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 2:7" />Na bunuubu, benu laafwana usa nde kolo-kolo na uhwadisa nde, mana munyoongo wu afulala bunene a habwisa hiitu hya nde. <verse eid="2CO 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 2:8" />Ni mu buuna, me pondi huli benu mu ubwemweese ti benu laatondo nde. <verse eid="2CO 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 2:9" />Mu mbuli, me miitsonehele benu, ni mu uyebe benu mu umono tso benu likini laavangama mu usiingala matumili ma me. <verse eid="2CO 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 2:10" />Ŋa benu luusa muutu kolo-kolo mu bubi bwa nde, me kaka utsa nde kolo-kolo. Na tso me atsiidi kolo-kolo, ŋa tooni yi usa kolo-kolo yamonihili, me atsa nde kolo-kolo ŋa busu bwa Kristo, mu tooni a benu, <verse eid="2CO 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 2:11" />mana Saatana a habiingala bisu. Mu tooni ati, bisu liyaabi bubwe-bubwe matsimi ma nde.<verse eid="2CO 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Pahuli hu musyenge a Torowasi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 2:12" />Ŋa me atoodi hu musyenge a Torowasi, me amoni ti Pfumu aviidi me nzila mu uyayabisa Musamu wu Mubwe wa Kristo. <verse eid="2CO 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 2:13" />Ka mutima a me aba helini-helini, bu me apelimbiisa mwana a ngu a me Tiite. Ni mu buuna, me andanisi bisu Torowasi na me anzyeni hu Masedonya<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 20:1">Mav 20.1</ref></char></note>.<verse eid="2CO 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mbiingili mu Yisu Kristo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 2:14" />Ka lifutalaani matondo huli Nzambi, mu tooni ati, nde li mu ubita bisu mu koonge a mbiingili itwadi na Kristo. Mu bisu, nde li mu uyabisa nduhi a Kristo huli baatu. Nzabisili mo yiina, yafwanina na tsulu yimbwe ya nyafi yi yili mu utsaamuha mu mambuha moosi. <verse eid="2CO 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 2:15" />Mu mbuli, bisu lili ŋa busu bwa Nzambi we nyafi yi bungodu bwa tsuhili ya Kristo, yi yili mu upalisa tsulu yimbwe. Bisu lili nyafi ya Kristo, ŋa hati la ba bali mu uyoboho na ba bali mu ukwa. <verse eid="2CO 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 2:16" />Huli bamosi, yo yili tsulu yi lipfu, yi yili mu ubita hu lipfu. Huli bakima, yo yili nyafi a moonyi, yi yili mu ubita hu moonyi. Na li na mifudi mu ukuhasa isalu mo hiniihi? <verse eid="2CO 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 2:17" />Mu mbuli, bisu a lili we bakima ba balahi ba bali mu usuumbasa mambu ma Nzambi ve. Ka Nzambi ni wu atsindaha bisu, na bisu ubaatoyo na imbuli ŋa busu bwa nde, itwadi na Kristo.<verse eid="2CO 2:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="2CO 3" />
  <para style="s1">Basalili ba Nzuhisini yi Nyatihi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 3:1" />Bisu a lili mu usaha nzila yi benu luusilasa bisu ve. Bisu a lili na nzala we bakima, mu usonehele benu mihanda mi uva benu muswa wu usilasa bisu, buuve mu uvondo benu myo ve. <verse eid="2CO 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 3:2" />Benu mwakulu ni ba lili muhanda a bisu, wu baasonehe hutso mitima mya bisu. Muhanda wu baatu boosi buutwala utaanga na utsikaha. <verse eid="2CO 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 3:3" />Eeye, hu li mu umonehele ti benu lili muhanda wu Kristo haasonehe, na wu bisu lili mu utoosele. A mu mwiindu baasonehe nde ve, ka mu Livupu la Nzambi a moonyi. A baahiratana nde ŋa yulu bibadi bi mamanya<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.3 </char><char style="xq" closed="false">bibadi bi mamanya </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 24:12">Pal 24.12</ref>; <ref loc="JER 31:33">Yel 31.33</ref></char></note> ve, ka ŋa yulu bibadi bi misunya, ŋa yulu mitima mya baatu.<verse eid="2CO 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 3:4" />Bisu lili mu utoyo buuna, mu tooni a hiitu hi bisu lili na hyo mu Nzambi mu likumbasa la Kristo. <verse eid="2CO 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 3:5" />Mu mbuli, bisu utwala usa isalu hya pila mo yiina mu matwala ma bisu mwakulu ve. Ka ni Nzambi ubaava bisu matwala ma ukuhasa ma bisu libaavaanga. <verse eid="2CO 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 3:6" />Ni nde ubaava bisu matwala ma usa isalu hya nde mu Nzuhisini yi Nyatihi. Nzuhisini mo yiina, a yaakangama hu tsina a Mabasonehe ve, ka yo yaakangama mu Livupu la Ngidi. Mabaasonehe mubaabita hu lipfu, ka Livupu la Ngidi libaabita hu moonyi<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 31:31">Yel 31.31</ref></char></note>.<verse eid="2CO 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 3:7" />Eeye, ni mbuli, Mikele mya Moose, mi baaba baahiratana ŋa yulu bibadi bi mamanya, myakamweese muyusu a Nzambi. Mu taangu mo yiina, hiinzi hya Moose hyaakamwedeme mu liyalala li linene, li bisu Isereli baakaveletwala usungamana<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 34:29">Pal 34.29</ref></char></note>. Ka liyalala mo liina, aba ndulu la mwana a taangu hoole. Tso Mikele mi mibaabita hu lipfu myakamwedeme na muyusu, <verse eid="2CO 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 3:8" />ki pila muyusu uvelefulala bunene, mu isalu hi Livupu la Nzambi libaasala! <verse eid="2CO 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 3:9" />Tso isalu hi hyaakava baatu tsyembili hyaaba na muyusu, ki pila muyusu uvelefulala bunene mu isalu hi baava baatu butsiitsa ŋa busu bwa Nzambi! <verse eid="2CO 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 3:10" />Bisu utwala mu uleele ti, muyusu wu amwedimi mu taangu a tsomi, utwala uyelemene na muyusu wa lolo yiniiyi wu alutahala bunene ve. <verse eid="2CO 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 3:11" />Mu mbuli, tso bisiha bi byaamiivyoho mwana a taangu hoole byaaba na muyusu, ki pila muyusu uvelefulala bunene mu bisiha bi bibaakwilala nzyeni!<verse eid="2CO 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 3:12" />Ni bu bisu lili na hiitu hya pila mo yiina, bisu laaluula na ibahala. <verse eid="2CO 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 3:13" />Bisu a lili mu usa we Moose wu akafuha mbalanga a nde mu nguumbu ve, mana bisu Isereli bavelemono uvolemene hu liyalala la Nzambi mu hiinzi hya nde<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 34:33">Pal 34.33</ref></char></note>. <verse eid="2CO 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 3:14" />Ka buyedi bwa bo bwaakangimi, natee lolo yiniiyi, nguumbu mo yiina yaafuha buyedi bwa bo, ŋa bo bubaataanga mabuuku ma Nzuhisini yi Kulu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3.14 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Nzuhisini yi Kulu </char><char style="ft" closed="false">buuve lahi li likulu.</char></note>. Nguumbu mo yiina, ubaamasa yo ndulu mu liyalala la Kristo. <verse eid="2CO 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 3:15" />Natee lolo yiniiyi, pasi taangu yi bo bali mu utaanga mihanda mya Moose, nguumbu yili mu ufuha buyedi bwa bo. <verse eid="2CO 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 3:16" />Ŋa muutu ubaakinguha huli Pfumu, ni ŋaana nguumbu yibaamata<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3.16 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Ŋa muutu ubaakinguha huli Pfumu...</char><char style="ft" closed="false">mbindulili kima, ŋa </char><char style="fqa">Moose</char> haakakinguha huli Pfumu, nguumbu a nde yaakamata <char style="xt"><ref loc="EXO 34:34">Pal 34.34</ref></char>.</note>. <verse eid="2CO 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 3:17" />Ka Pfumu ni Livupu. Ŋa mbuha yi Livupu la Pfumu lili, ni ŋaana bunyanga kaka buli. <verse eid="2CO 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 3:18" />Bisu boosi, ba baamiimaasa nguumbu mu hiinzi, muyusu a Pfumu li mu umonehele mu bisu. Buuna, Livupu laamiisobo bisu, na bisu laaka ifwafwani hya Pfumu. Eeye, bisu laamiisiisa muyusu wu mukeehe, mu uvyoho hu muyusu wu alutahala bunene. Maana moosi ni mambu ma Pfumu ali mu uvaanga, nde wu li Livupu.<verse eid="2CO 3:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="2CO 4" />
  <para style="s">Busina bu Livupu hutso bitehili bya mu diiha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 4:1" />Mu tooni a kwili a nde lingebe, Nzambi amiiva bisu isalu mo hiniihi, ni mu buuna, bisu a lili mu ukolo binama ve. <verse eid="2CO 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 4:2" />Bisu laamiibisa tsalili yoosi ya swehe-swehe na ya tsonyi. Bisu a libaadyata mu soho ve na bisu a libaasobo maambu ma Nzambi ve. Homo ati, bisu lili mu umweese imbuli we bu hwaafwana. Na bisu lili mu usa ti, pasi muutu atsikaha tso mbuli ni mu nduhi a Nzambi bisu libaasala, buuve naana. <verse eid="2CO 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 4:3" />Ka, tso Musamu wu Mubwe wu bisu lili mu uyaabisa kini wu baafuha, nde li wu baaswehe huli ba bali mu ukwa. <verse eid="2CO 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 4:4" />Bo a bali mu usa imiinu ve. Mu tooni ati, Saatana, wu li nzambi a taangu mo yiniiyi, amiifuha matsimi ma banga a paha. Nde haasa buuna, mana bo bavelemono liyalala li Musamu wu Mubwe wu muyusu a Kristo, nde wu li ifwaani hya Nzambi. <verse eid="2CO 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 4:5" />Mu mbuli, mu ndongisili a bisu, a mu bisu mwakulu bisu libaalongese ve, ka bisu Yisu Kristo wu li Pfumu libaalongese. Ka uto ti bisu, bisu lili basalili ba Yisu. <verse eid="2CO 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 4:6" />Nzambi aleele hu tsikulu bunuubu: «Nyaha liyalala limwedeme hutso a piipidi ya dunga-dunga<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 1:3">Mba 1.3</ref></char></note>!» Eeye, ni nde kaka li mu umwedemese liyalala la nde hutso mitima mya bisu, mu uva bisu nzaabili yi yaayaluha yi muyusu a nde, wu li mu umonehele mu hiinzi hya Kristo.<verse eid="2CO 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 4:7" />Ka bisu libaakeelese busina mo bunuubu, we mutso bitehili bya mu diiha, mana libaamweese ti matwala mo ma manene maana, mali mu umata huli Nzambi, ka a huli bisu ve. <verse eid="2CO 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 4:8" />Mapasi ma pila mu pila mali mu ukwamisa bisu mu pasi tsyelo, ka a maabiingala bisu ve. Bisu liba hutso a paha, hiitu hili. <verse eid="2CO 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 4:9" />Bali mu utsuta bisu, ka Nzambi a haasiisa bisu siha ve. Bali mu ubwiisa bisu ŋa toto, ka bisu a laahesoho ve. <verse eid="2CO 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 4:10" />Tangu yoosi, bisu lili mu ukeelese lipfu la Yisu mu nyutu a bisu, mana moonyi a nde amonehele kaka mu nyutu a bisu. <verse eid="2CO 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 4:11" />Tso bisu lili moonyi, bisu lili tangu yoosi laayandama na lipfu mu tooni a Yisu, mana moonyi a nde amonehele kaka mu nyutu a bisu yi yiukwa. <verse eid="2CO 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 4:12" />Buuna, lipfu lili mu usala mu bisu, mana moonyi asala mu benu.<verse eid="2CO 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 4:13" />Mabasonehe ma Ngidi mali mu uleele: «Me atsa imiinu, ni mu buuna me atoyo<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 116:10">Mkg 116.10</ref></char></note>.» Bisu kaka, mu matsimi mamosi ma imiinu, lili mu usa imiinu, ni mu buuna bisu lili mu utoyo. <verse eid="2CO 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 4:14" />Mu mbuli, bisu liyaabi ti, Nzambi wu asuuli Pfumu Yisu mu babaakwa, usuula kaka bisu mu ba baakwa itwadi na Yisu, na utelemese bisu na benu ŋa busu bwa nde. <verse eid="2CO 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 4:15" />Moosi ma bisu lili mu ukuunda, ni mu libwe la benu, mana hyese hya Nzambi hifulala uto mu baatu ba balahi, na hisinzapfunasa masambulu ma pfutili matondo mu muyusu a Nzambi.<verse eid="2CO 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Muyusu wu udiinga mu bilima na bilima</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 4:16" />Ni mu buuna, bisu laavelebila ukolo binama. Tso bu linyutu la bisu lili mu usyeheme hoole-hoole, Nzambi li mu uhwadisa mitima mya bisu mu pasi ilumbu. <verse eid="2CO 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 4:17" />Mapasi ma bisu lili mu umono mu mwana a taangu hoole, maaleenge. Utwala ufwanisa mo na bunene bu muyusu wu bilima na bilima ve, wu afulala tsoongo, wu nde ali mu uswehele bisu. <verse eid="2CO 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 4:18" />Bisu a lili mu usuusa matsimi ma bisu mu bisiha bi bisu lili mu umono ve, ka ni mu bisiha bi bisu laavelemono. Mu tooni ati, bisiha bi bisu lili mu umono, a byudiinga tso hoole ve, ka bisiha bi bisu laavelemono, byudiinga mu bilima na bilima.<verse eid="2CO 4:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="2CO 5" />
  <para style="s1">Muyusu wu bilima na bilima wu uya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 5:1" />Mu mbuli, bisu liyaabi ti, tso nyutu a bisu yili we nzo, yi bisu lili mu utsahala mu yo, ni nzo a bisu ya toto. Tso yo yitsaamuhi, yaabaani ti, Nzambi amiituungala bisu nzo hu mayulu, yi baaveletuunga mu myoho mya baatu, nzo yi yiukwilala mu bilima na bilima. <verse eid="2CO 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 5:2" />Na bunuubu, bisu lili mu ubima mutso a nzo mo yiina, mu tooni ati, lehemene la bisu lili li linene, mu ukoto mu nzo a bisu ya hu mayulu. <verse eid="2CO 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 5:3" />Mu mbuli, tso bisu likoti mu nzo mo yiina, bisu luuba ba baafuha. <verse eid="2CO 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 5:4" />Eeye, bu bisu likini mu utsahala mu nzo ya toto yi yiuvelediinga yiniiyi, bisu lili mu ubima we baatu ba bali mu ubita mupfuna. A hu li mu uleele ve ti, bisu litondi umaasa nyutu a bisu ya toto, ka bisu litondi uyaka nyutu ya hu mayulu, mana idiingu ikitula bi byukwa. <verse eid="2CO 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 5:5" />Ni Nzambi nde mwakulu avangimisi bisu mu maana, na nde amiiva bisu Livupu la nde we tsuha yi nde haamiisa bisu lahi.<verse eid="2CO 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 5:6" />Buuna, taangu yoosi bisu laaluula mu ibahala! Bisu liyaabi ti, bu likini mu nyutu mo yiniiyi, bisu lili mu ukwilala lala na Pfumu. <verse eid="2CO 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 5:7" />Mu mbuli, bisu lili mu udyata mu imiinu, ka a mu umono hwa miisu ve. <verse eid="2CO 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 5:8" />Bisu laaluula mu ibahala, na bisu laamiivangama mu utiimba nyutu mo yiniiyi, mu uyakwilala huli Pfumu. <verse eid="2CO 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 5:9" />Ka bisu lili mu utsima umaamweese nde kinya, tso bisu likwilili mu nyutu mo yiniiyi, buuve tso litiimbi yo. <verse eid="2CO 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 5:10" />Mu tooni ati, bisu boosi laafwana uteleme ŋa busu bwa Kristo mu uyaka tsundusu a nde. Ni huuna, muutu muutu sa ayaka wa nde musyendo mu mamabwe buuve mamabi ma nde haavaangi ŋa toto.<verse eid="2CO 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kristo miifutala inoongi hya bisu na Nzambi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 5:11" />Bisu liyaabi bubwe-bubwe buni luutwala ukiinza Pfumu. Buuna, bisu lili mu usaha ubita baatu mu usobo matsimi ma bo. Nzambi ayaaba bisu bubwe-bubwe na me tsimi ti, hutso mitima mya benu, benu liyaabi bisu kaka. <verse eid="2CO 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 5:12" />Bisu a litondi ubula tulu bisu mwakulu ŋa busu bwa benu ve. Ka bisu na nzala ti benu linyemele bisu. Buuna, benu luubaha ma benu luukaala huli baatu ba bubaanyemele bi bibaamonehele mu miisu, ka a mu bya hutso mutima ve. <verse eid="2CO 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 5:13" />Tso mu mbuli bisu lili biyahudi, ni mu tooni a Nzambi bisu lili biyahudi. Ka tso bisu lili batsiitsa, ni mu tooni a benu bisu lili batsiitsa. <verse eid="2CO 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 5:14" />Mu mbuli, litondo la Kristo lili mu ubamiha bisu mu utsikaha ti: muutu ndulu mumosi amiikwa mu tooni a baatu boosi, na ni buuna, baatu boosi baamiikwa. <verse eid="2CO 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 5:15" />Nde akwiidi mu libwe la boosi, mana ba bali moonyi baveledyata mu bo mwakulu, ka bo baba moonyi mu muutu wu akwiidi, na wu asuuhi mu babaakwa mu libwe la bo.<verse eid="2CO 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 5:16" />Ni mu buuna, bisu a lili mu ubweyaaba muutu mu nzaabili yi bumuutu ve. Tso hu tsikulu, bisu laakayaaba Kristo mu nzaabili yi bumuutu, ka mu taangu mo yiniiyi, bisu a lili mu ubweyaaba nde buuna ve. <verse eid="2CO 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 5:17" />Tso muutu li itwadi mu Kristo, nde li ivaangu hi inyatihi. Mbiili yikulu yimiidimbala, bunuubu, mbiili a nde ka yinyatihi<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5.17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 43:18-19">Esa 43.18-19</ref></char></note>. <verse eid="2CO 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 5:18" />Mambu mo maana moosi maamati huli Nzambi, wu anongisi bisu na nde mu nzila a Kristo, na wu aviidi bisu isalu hi unongese baatu bakima na nde. <verse eid="2CO 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CO 5:19" />Eeye, ni mu Kristo, Nzambi haakasala mu unongese baatu ba tsi na nde, hwavele utaanga mamabi ma bo. Na nde atumi bisu, mu uyayabisa musamu wu inoongi.<verse eid="2CO 5:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CO 5:20" />Buuna, bisu lili banzonzi ba Kristo haatsindaha, ni we bu Nzambi nde mwakulu ali mu uvyohele mu bisu, mu usa teelili a nde. Bisu lili mu uyayaana benu, mu nduhi a Kristo, noongwaani na Nzambi. <verse eid="2CO 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CO 5:21" />Kristo a haasiidi lisumu tso limosi ve. Ka Nzambi akwiihi nde masumu ma bisu, mana bu luuba itwadi na nde, bisu liba batsiitsa ŋa busu bwa Nzambi.<verse eid="2CO 5:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="2CO 6" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 6:1" />Mu mbuli, bu bisu libaasala itwadi na Nzambi, bisu lili mu uvondo huli benu, mu uvelesa dyedyeke mu hyese hi benu laayaki huli Nzambi. <verse eid="2CO 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 6:2" />Eeye, Nzambi li mu uleele bunuubu:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 6:2">«Mu taangu yi yaafwana, me anzahuli we,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 6:2">mu ilumbu hi liyobolo, me anzakumbasa we<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6.2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 49:8">Esa 49.8</ref></char></note>.»</para>
  <para style="m" vid="2CO 6:2">Eeye, yiniiyi ka ni tangu yi yaafwana mu uyaka hyese hya Nzambi. Mono ilumbu hi liyobolo!<verse eid="2CO 6:2" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bikahu bi byahwama na nzabisili a Musamu wu Mubwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 6:3" />Bisu lili mu upeke, mu uvelekubasa muutu tso mumosi baku mu pasi musamu, mana bavelekusa isalu hya bisu. <verse eid="2CO 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 6:4" />Homo, mu pasi musamu, bisu libaamonehele basalili ba Nzambi ba mbuli. Bisu lili mu ukuunda na mukonono woosi, mapasi, minyongi na boomo. <verse eid="2CO 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 6:5" />Baabeeti bisu na baabwaahi bisu mu kondaayi<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6.5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 16:23">Mav 16.23</ref></char></note>, baatuumbisi baatu mu usa isalu hya bisu muyunga. Baakwamisi bisu bisalu bya pasi, bisu laakakiila iriimba na laakadya ikaandi. <verse eid="2CO 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 6:6" />Bisu lili basalili ba Nzambi bangidi, banga a nzaabili, banga mukami na banga mutima bubwe. Livupu la Ngidi libaasala mu bisu, litondo la bisu lili la mbuli, <verse eid="2CO 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 6:7" />bisu lili mu uyabisa musamu wu imbuli mu matwala ma Nzambi. Mu hooho hwa mbahala na hwa kaasu, bisu lili na bilwanili bi butsiitsa bwa Nzambi. <verse eid="2CO 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 6:8" />Baatu bubaayuusa bisu, na bakima bubaarokolo bisu: tso utuha bisu tso ukiinza bisu. Bo bali mu utsima ti bisu bapfuti lili, ka hwande bisu imbuli lili mu uleele. <verse eid="2CO 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 6:9" />Bo bali mu uvolo bisu we baatu ba baaveleyabahana, kaahu baayaaba bisu bubwe-bubwe. Bo bali mu umono bisu we baatu ba baaka mu ukwa, kaahu bisu lili moonyi. Bo bali mu usyembe bisu hu unono, kaahu bo a bali mu uduba bisu ve. <verse eid="2CO 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 6:10" />Bo bali mu uva bisu lingebe, ka hwande bisu lili mu kinya. Bo bali mu utsima ti bisu biyaha lili, ka bisu lili mu usa ti baatu ba balahi baba bisina. Bisu lili mu umonehele we ba baavele na isiha, kaahu mu mbuli, bisu laabaha byosi!<verse eid="2CO 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 6:11" />Bisu laatoyo na benu na imbuli hyoosi, bambaahi ba musyenge a Koliito, bisu laasinzayalusa benu mutima a bisu. <verse eid="2CO 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 6:12" />Litondo la bisu mu benu a lili na ndilu ve, ka ni benu mwakulu lili mu usa ndilu mu litondo la benu mu bisu. <verse eid="2CO 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 6:13" />Buuna, me ndi mu utoyo na benu we bu taata ubaatoyo na baana ba nde. Siingalaani litondo la bisu, baasinzayalusaani bisu mutima a benu!<verse eid="2CO 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">A laabaambana na bubi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 6:14" />A laabaambana na ba baavelesa imiinu mu Nzambi. Mu mbuli, buni hi hili butsiitsa hyutwala ubaambana na hi ibi? Buni liyalala luutwala ubaambana na piipidi? <verse eid="2CO 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 6:15" />Buni Kristo huutwala ubaambana na Saatana? Buuve, buni nga imiinu mu Nzambi huutwala ubaambana na wu avelesa imiinu mu Nzambi? <verse eid="2CO 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 6:16" />Ki hyenze hyutwala uba ŋa hati la nzo a Nzambi na nzo yi bifwita? Mu tooni ati, bisu a benu ni nzo a Nzambi ya Nzambi a moonyi.</para>
  <para style="m" vid="2CO 6:16">We bu Nzambi nde mwakulu haleeli lo:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 6:16">«Me ukwilala uba, na me undyata ŋa hati la bo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 6:16">me umba Nzambi a bo, na bo buuba buli la me.<verse eid="2CO 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 6:17" />Palaani ŋa hati la bo, na tahuhaani na bo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 6:17">A libeembe pasi hyo hi hyasumaha ve,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 6:17">na me, me unzaka benu.<verse eid="2CO 6:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 6:18" />Me umba Taata a benu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 6:18">na benu luuba baana ba me,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 6:18">ba babahala na ba bakaasu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 6:18">huleeli Pfumu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 6:18">Nzambi Pungu nga Matwala<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6.18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 7:14">2Sa 7.14</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 26:12">Lev 26.12</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 43:6">Esa 43.6</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 52:11">Esa 52.11</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 37:27">Ezk 37.27</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 20:34">20.34</ref></char></note>.»<verse eid="2CO 6:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="2CO 7" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 7:1" />Bambaahi ba litondo, malahi mo maniima moosi mali ma bisu. Ni mu buuna, litsyemaani mu byosi bi bibaasumana musunya buuve muvumu, na lihwadaani mu uba baatu bangidi na ubata boomo bwa Nzambi.<verse eid="2CO 7:1" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kinya a Pahuli mu tsobili a mbiili a libundu la Koliito</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 7:2" />Vangilaani bisu mbuha mu mutima a benu! Bisu a laavangila pasi muutu libi ve, bisu a laatsambimasa pasi muutu ve, bisu a laayuya pasi muutu ve. <verse eid="2CO 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 7:3" />Me a handi mu undeele buuna mu usyembe benu ve. Mu mbuli, we bu me amiitsilasa lo, benu lili baatu ba laafulala tsoongo huli bisu. Bisu lili itwadi na benu, tso mu lipfu, tso mu moonyi. <verse eid="2CO 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 7:4" />Me ndi na hiitu hiinene mu benu, me ndi na nyeme yindahi mu benu! Mu minyongi mya bisu myosi, me amiikwilala wu aluula mu ibahala, na kinya a me yaamiivyohelele iteesi.<verse eid="2CO 7:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 7:5" />Mu mbuli, tso ŋa bisu laatoodi hu Masedonya, nyutu a bisu a yaavuumi tso hoole ve. Bisu laabwani mapasi ma pila mu pila: midiingu mu muvanga a bisu, na boomo hutso mitima. <verse eid="2CO 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 7:6" />Ka Nzambi wu ubaatelemese ibahala hya ba baamiikolo binama, ahwadisi bisu mu nziili a Tiite. <verse eid="2CO 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 7:7" />Ndulu a nziili a nde yaamweesi me kinya ve, ka naapa ikuumbu hya nde bu benu laahwadisi nde mwakulu. Nde ayabisi bisu ti benu laaba na nzala yi ubwemono me, mu lingebe la benu, mu lehemene la benu mu ukalila me. Na mono buni kinya a me yaafulala bunene.<verse eid="2CO 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 7:8" />Mu mbuli, muhanda wu me atsonihi anyoongisi benu. Me amoni pasi mu lo, ŋa me amoni ti muhanda mo wuuna anyoongisi benu mu mwana a taangu hoole. Ka me a handi mu umono pasi mu lo lolo yiniiyi ve. <verse eid="2CO 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 7:9" />Bunuubu, me ndi na kinya, a mu tooni a bu me apaangili benu lilibi ve. Ka me ndi na kinya, mu tooni a bu munyoongo a benu haasa ti benu lisobo mbiili. Nzambi aba atondo munyoongo mo wuuna. Ni mu buuna, bisu a laavaangili benu lilibi ve! <verse eid="2CO 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 7:10" />Ni mu buuna, munyoongo wu ubaamata mu ngetetee ya na Nzambi, ubaabita hu tsobili a idiingu hi hibaabita hu liyobolo, hwaavele unyoongo mu lo. Ka munyoongo wu ubaamata mu ukangama hwa na baatu ba tsi mo yiniiyi, ubaabita hu lipfu. <verse eid="2CO 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 7:11" />Bunuubu, monwaani kaluha yi munyoongo wu ubaamata mu ukangama hwa na Nzambi: ki pila a litondo lilibwe huli benu, ki pila matutatsye mu ukala linyutu la benu! Ki pila lingebe, ki pila a boomo, ki pila a nzala yi ubwemono me, ki pila a lehemene, ki pila mifudi mi usyembe bubi! Benu laamweesi mu biteesi byosi ti, benu velelee lili mu dyambu li laamweesi benu lingebe.<verse eid="2CO 7:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 7:12" />Tso me atsonehele benu muhanda, a mu tooni a nde wuuna wu avaanga dyambu lilibi ve, buuve mu tooni a muutu wu baavangila lilibi ve. Ka mu tooni ati, benu lisinzatsikaha ŋa busu bwa Nzambi, ki pila litondo benu lili na lo mu ukumbasa bisu. <verse eid="2CO 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 7:13" />Ni mu buuna, mambu mo maana maahwadisi bisu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CO 7:13">Mu mbuli bisu laahwadi binama, titswene bisu laamoni kinya yi yaafulala, mu umono buni Tiite haaba mu kinya, bu benu boosi laasutisi matsimi ma nde. <verse eid="2CO 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 7:14" />Me anyemili benu mwana a hoole ŋa busu bwa Tiite. Mu liina, benu a laamweesi me tsonyi ve! Ka, we bu bisu libaaleele benu imbuli taangu yoosi, ni bumosi kaka, mabyoho ma bisu laabulili benu huli Tiite, aba ma mbuli. <verse eid="2CO 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 7:15" />Na buuna, litondo la nde mu benu laabwefulala bunene, ŋa nde ubaayibuhala moonyi buni benu boosi laasiingili, na buni benu laayaki nde na bulembo, na likiinzu. <verse eid="2CO 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 7:16" />Me ndi na kinya, mu tooni ati, me miitsikaha ti me ndi na hiitu mu benu mu moosi.<verse eid="2CO 7:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="2CO 8" />
  <para style="s1">Uva mu mutima wu ayaluha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 8:1" />Baana ba ngu, bisu na nzala ati benu liyaaba buni hyese hya Nzambi hyaamonihili mu mabundu ma hu Masedonya. <verse eid="2CO 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 8:2" />Baatu ba mabundu mo maana, a baabeedi na busina bu bulahi ve. Na bo baaba hutso minyongi mi minono. Ka kinya a bo aba yaafulala bunene, na bo baakamweese buni bo baayaaba ukabila bana, tso bu baaba hutso buyaha bu bwafulala. <verse eid="2CO 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 8:3" />Me ndi mbangi, bo baakava mbongo we bu hwaba mifudi mya mbahili a bo, natee uvyoselele iteesi, bo baakasa maana mu mutima mumosi. <verse eid="2CO 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 8:4" />Bo baakavondo muswa taangu yoosi, mu ubaha hyese hi utsindaha likumbasa li itwadi, huli bangidi ba hu Yeruselemi<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8.4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 15:26">Lom 15.26</ref> </char></note>. <verse eid="2CO 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 8:5" />Baatu ba mabundu mo maana, baviidi uvyohelele iteesi hi bisu laakakeele. Bo baamateehele umweese lehemene la bo mu uva huli Pfumu, na titswene huli bisu, we bu hu li litondo la Nzambi. <verse eid="2CO 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 8:6" />Ni mu buuna, bisu laavondo huli Tiite, mu usala isalu hi litondo hiniihi huli benu natee tsukusu, we bu nde haabaandihi hyo. <verse eid="2CO 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 8:7" />Benu lili na byosi mu iteesi hi hyalutahala: imiinu, bungodu bu bitoyili, nzaabili, lehemene li laavele na ndilu na litondo li bisu laatelimisi mu benu. Mu bungodu mo buuna bwosi, mwesaani ti benu laafulala na litondo.<verse eid="2CO 8:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 8:8" />A tumili me ndi mu upa benu ve. Ka me ndeeli buuna, mu li litali lehemene la bana, mu uva benu nzila yi umweese biliimbu bi imbuli hi litondo la benu. <verse eid="2CO 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 8:9" />Mu tooni ati, benu liyaabi buni hu li hyese hya Pfumu a bisu, Yisu Kristo. Nde wu aba isina, nde asiingi uba iyaha mu libwe la benu, mana nde akitusa benu bisina mu buyaha bwa nde.<verse eid="2CO 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 8:10" />Ndoongi yi me ndi mu upa benu mu dyambu li ukabila bungodu, ni yiniiyi: hu li bubwe huli benu mu usa mukonono. Benu laabeedi batsomi mu ilima hi hyaavyohi, ndulu a mu ukuukaha bungodu mo buuna ve, ka naapa mu uvolo kesili yi ukuukaha bwo. <verse eid="2CO 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 8:11" />Ka bunuubu, hwadaani mu umanisala isalu mo hiina! Mwesaani lehemene mu umanisala hyo, we lehemene li benu laaba na lo ŋa mbandihili, we bu hu li mbahili a benu. <verse eid="2CO 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 8:12" />Tso limweesi litondo lilibwe mu ukabila bungodu mo buuna, Nzambi uyaka bwo. Nde uyaka bungodu bwa pila mu pila, bu nde ubaamono bi lili na byo, ka a bi laavele na byo ve.<verse eid="2CO 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 8:13" />A hutondi uleele ve ti, mu ukumbasa bakima benu likituha bapuumbu, ka mana baatu boosi baba tsiitsa. <verse eid="2CO 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 8:14" />Mu taangu mo yiniiyi, benu lili na byosi mu iteesi hi hyalutahala, ni liina luusa ti benu likumbasa ba baakeehele. Ni bumosi kaka hu busu, tso benu likeehili na bo ba bali na busina, bo utwala ukumbasa benu. Buuna, benu boosi luuba tsiitsa. <verse eid="2CO 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 8:15" />We bu Mabasonehe ma Ngidi mali mu uleele:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 8:15">«Woosi wu akuukihi byo bi bilahi, a haaba na byo bi byalutahala ve,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 8:15">na woosi wu akuukihi byo hoole, a haakavele na byo ve<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8.15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 16:18">Pal 16.18</ref></char></note>.»<verse eid="2CO 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Tiite na bambaahi ba nde</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 8:16" />Me ndi mu upfutala matondo huli Nzambi, wu asuusi lehemene li lilahi mu mutima a Tiite, we li bisu lili na lo mu isalu hya benu. <verse eid="2CO 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 8:17" />Tiite asiingi pondili a bisu, homo ati, bu nde haaba wu asinzaluula mu lehemene. Ni mu buuna, nde avoli kesili masulubete, mu uyene huli benu. <verse eid="2CO 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 8:18" />Itwadi na Tiite, bisu lili mu utsindaha benu mwana a ngu mumosi, wu mabundu moosi mali mu ubulala mabyoho. Mu tooni a bu nde haateleme mu isalu hi Musamu wu Mubwe. <verse eid="2CO 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CO 8:19" />Homo ati, mabundu maasooli nde mu uba mbaahi a bisu wu midyenge, mu ubehele bo bungodu bwa bisu boosi, mu muyusu a Pfumu nde mwakulu, na umweese litondo la bisu lilibwe.<verse eid="2CO 8:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CO 8:20" />Bisu a litondi ve ti basyembe tsalili a bisu mu musiiku a mbongo mo yiniiyi. <verse eid="2CO 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CO 8:21" />Bisu lili mu usaha uvaanga mamabwe, ndulu a ŋa busu bwa Pfumu ve, ka naapa ŋa busu bwa baatu boosi<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8.21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 12:17">Lom 12.17</ref></char></note>.<verse eid="2CO 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CO 8:22" />Bisu lili mu utsindaha mwana a ngu a bisu mumosi na bo. Bisu laabahi mataangu ma malahi ma uyebe nde, ka nde akamonehele nga a lehemene taangu yoosi. Ka bunuubu, nde li mu ubwemonehele nga a lehemene li laafulala, mu tooni a hiitu hiinene hi nde ali na hyo mu benu. <verse eid="2CO 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CO 8:23" />Mu li litali Tiite, nde li mbaahi a me mu imiinu, na mbaahi a me mu isalu hya Kristo huli benu. Ka mu li litali baana ba ngu ba bisu bakima ba bali mu udyenge na nde, bo bali biluumbi bi mabundu. Bo bali mu usala mu muyusu a Kristo. <verse eid="2CO 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CO 8:24" />Mwesaani ti benu laatondo bo mu mbuli, mana mabundu maba na hiitu mu litondo mo liina na mayaaba ti bisu na mbiinga mu unyemele benu!<verse eid="2CO 8:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="2CO 9" />
  <para style="s1">Likumbasa huli mabundu ma hu Yeruselemi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 9:1" />A hu li na tsoongo mu usonehele benu mu li litali likumbasa li ubitala bangidi ba bali hu Yeruselemi ve. <verse eid="2CO 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 9:2" />Mu mbuli, me nzaabi ti litondo la benu lili lilibwe. Me ambuli tulu mu benu ŋa busu bwa bisu Masedonya ŋa me andeeli ti: «Baana ba ngu ba hu Akayi baamiivangama mu ukuukaha bungodu bwa bo umata ilima hi himiivyoho<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 8:10">8.10</ref> </char></note>.» Lehemene la benu, laatelimisi baana ba ngu ba balahi ŋa hati la bo. <verse eid="2CO 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 9:3" />Ka me ndi mu utsindaha benu baana ba ngu mo baniiba, mana mabyoho ma bisu lili mu ubulala benu mu dyambu li ukabila bungodu, a maba ma mu pu. Me tondi ti benu livangama nzyeni, we bu me andeele lo. <verse eid="2CO 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 9:4" />Kini a buuna ve, tso bisu Masedonya bayidi na me, na bavelibiisa benu ba baavangama, bisu luumono tsonyi tso liyabiisa benu ba baavelevangama, mu tooni ati, bisu laaba laasa hiitu mu benu. Benu kaka luumono tsonyi. <verse eid="2CO 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 9:5" />Ni mu buuna, me amono tsoongo mu uvondo baana ba ngu mo baana, mu uteehele me uya huli benu, mu uvangimasa tsonzihili yi bungodu bu benu laamiikwasa lahi. Buuna, ŋa me unza, bwo buuba bu bwavangama na buumwese ti benu libaava mu mutima wu ayaluha, ka a mu mutima wu akangama ve.<verse eid="2CO 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 9:6" />Yibuhalaani moonyi mu dyambu mo liniili ti: Woosi wu ukuna na dyedyeke, sa akuukaha bya hoole, na woosi wu ukuna bi bilahi, sa akuukaha bi byalutahala iteesi. <verse eid="2CO 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 9:7" />Buuna, nyaha pasi muutu ava we bu nde atsimi mu mutima a nde, hwavele lingebe, buuve kwamisa. Mu tooni ati, Nzambi atondo muutu wu ubaava na kinya. <verse eid="2CO 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 9:8" />Na Nzambi li na matwala ma uluusa benu mu mabwe ma pila mu pila. Bu benu luuluula mu bi benu lili na byo nzala, benu luubwebaha taangu yoosi bi byalutahala bulahi, mana benu libaakumbasa bakima mu mavaanga ma mabwe ma pila mu pila. <verse eid="2CO 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 9:9" />Mabasonehe ma Ngidi mali mu uleele:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 9:9">«Nde ubaava mu iteesi hi hyalutahala huli bapuumbu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 9:9">na bubwe bwa nde bubaakwilala taangu yoosi<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 112:9">Mkg 112.9</ref></char></note>.»<verse eid="2CO 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 9:10" />Nzambi wu ubaava muhunu huli mukuni na lipa li libaabuungala nde<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 55:10">Esa 55.10</ref></char></note>, sa ava benu mu iteesi hi hyafulala, muhunu wu benu lili na nde nzala. Nde upfunasa na ukulasa muhunu, mana butsiitsa bwa benu bubuta mimbutu mi milahi. <verse eid="2CO 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 9:11" />Nde ukitusa benu bisina mu moosi, mana benu libaakumbasa baatu hwavele ukolo. Buuna, baatu ba balahi buufutala matondo huli Nzambi, mu makabu ma benu, ma bisu luutoosele huli bo. <verse eid="2CO 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 9:12" />Mu tooni ati, tsonzihili a makabu yi benu lili mu usa yiniiyi, a yili mu umana ndulu manzala ma baatu bangidi ve. Ka yo yili mu usinzapfunasa pfutilili matondo huli Nzambi. <verse eid="2CO 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 9:13" />Mu umono tsalu a likumbasa la benu, ba balahi buuyuusa Nzambi. Bo buuyuusa nde mu tooni ati, benu lili mu usiingala nde na lili ngetetee mu Musamu wu Mubwe wa Kristo. Na bo buuyuusa nde kaka, ŋa benu luukaakabasana busina bwa benu itwadi na bo, na bakima boosi. <verse eid="2CO 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 9:14" />Bo buukaasambila mu benu, mu umwese benu litondo la bo, na mu tooni a hyese hi hyafulala hi Nzambi haamiiva benu. <verse eid="2CO 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 9:15" />Lifutalaani matondo huli Nzambi, mu bungodu bwa nde bu buuvelefwanisa na pasi isiha.<verse eid="2CO 9:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="2CO 10" />
  <para style="s1">Pahuli li mu ulwanila isalu hya nde</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 10:1" />Me Pahuli, me mwakulu ndi mu upondo benu, mu bulembo, na bubwe bwa Kristo. Baatu bali mu uleele ti: me ndi «nga kulimini» mu taangu yi me ndi na benu, ka «nga ibahala», mu taangu yi me ndi lala na benu. <verse eid="2CO 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 10:2" />Me ndi mu undembesene benu: a likwamisa me mu utoyo mu mifudi mu taangu yi me umba itwadi na benu ve. Ka me tsatoyo mu mifudi, ŋa busu bwa ba bali mu utsima ti, bisu lili mu usalila imuutu. <verse eid="2CO 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 10:3" />Ni mbuli, bisu libaadyata mu musunya, ka bisu a lili mu ulwana mu musunya ve! <verse eid="2CO 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 10:4" />Mu mudiingu a bisu, bilwanili bi lili mu usalila, a bili bi musunya ve. Ka byo bili na matwala ma Nzambi, mu utsala bibaha bi byaavangama: ni matsimi ma mapfuta. <verse eid="2CO 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 10:5" />Na bisu lili mu utsala bisiha byosi bi mapfuta bi bibaatelemene nzaabili a Nzambi. Bisu lili mu ukotese matsimi ma mabi moosi ikondaayi, mana hu mbisa isalu hya bisu, baatu mo baana basiingala Kristo. <verse eid="2CO 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 10:6" />Na bisu lili ba laavangama mu usyembe kene yoosi, natee bu benu luumweese lisiingala li laasupaha mu Kristo.<verse eid="2CO 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 10:7" />Monwaani buni mambu ma bumuutu mali! Eeye, tso muutu nde mwakulu na hiitu ti nde li wa Kristo, nyaha nde abwetsikaha liniili ti: bisu kaka lili ba Kristo we nde! <verse eid="2CO 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 10:8" />Bamosi bali mu utsima peleve ti, me amiipfulala unyemele lituma li Pfumu haava bisu. Ka lituma mo liina ni li utuunga libundu la benu, a li utsala lo ve<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 1:10">Yel 1.10</ref>; <ref loc="JER 24:6">24.6</ref>; <ref loc="JER 31:28">31.28</ref>; <ref loc="JER 42:10">42.10</ref>; <ref loc="JER 45:4">45.4</ref> </char></note>. Me a handi na tsonyi mu lo ve. <verse eid="2CO 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 10:9" />Me a hatondi umonehele we muutu wu uva benu boomo mu mihanda mya me ve. <verse eid="2CO 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 10:10" />Mu mbuli, monwaani ma bo bali mu uleele mu tooni a me: «Mihanda mya Pahuli mili mi minono na mi bukanyi. Ka ŋa nde ali ŋa hati la bisu mu musunya, nde li wu akolo, na biyambili bya nde a bili na lisuunga ve.» <verse eid="2CO 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 10:11" />Nyaha wu li mu uleele buuna ayaaba lo bubwe ti: mbiili a bisu ŋa lili mu usonehe mihanda mya bisu hu lala, ni yo moosi yuuba ŋa bisu luuba mbuha mosi.<verse eid="2CO 10:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Isalu hi Nzambi amiiva huli Pahuli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 10:12" />Mu mbuli, bisu a luubila uyelemene tsiitsa na baatu bakima ba bubaasilasa bo mwakulu ve, buuve ufwanina na bo mwakulu. Bo bitsuudu bali: bo bali mu uyelemese byetso mu bo mwakulu mu umweese buni bo bali. <verse eid="2CO 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 10:13" />Ka uto ti bisu, bisu a luusa nyeme yi yaafulala iteesi ve. Bisu luusa nyeme mu hyetso hi mandilu ma isalu hi Nzambi haava bisu, mu utoose bisu natee huli benu. <verse eid="2CO 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 10:14" />Bisu a luuvyoho mandilu ma bisu ve, we tso bisu ba likiiveleto huli benu. Mu tooni ati, bisu ni batsomi mu uto huli benu, mu ubehele benu Musamu wu Mubwe wa Kristo. <verse eid="2CO 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 10:15" />Buuna, bisu a luusa nyeme mu iteesi hi hyaafulala ve, mu isalu hi bakima baasa. Ka bisu lili na hiitu ti, imiinu hya benu hyuukula, na ti bisu luukuhasa isalu hi hyaafulala bunene ŋa hati la benu. Ka bisu luukuhasa hyo, mu mandilu ma baava bisu. <verse eid="2CO 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 10:16" />Titswene, bisu luubita Musamu wu Mubwe mu bitaanzi bi bili lala na benu, hwavele usa nyeme mu kaluha yi isalu hi baatu bakima baasa mu ngundu a bo. <verse eid="2CO 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 10:17" />Ka baasonehe bunuubu: «Tso muutu tondi usa nyeme, nyaha nde asa nyeme mu Pfumu haavaanga<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 9:23">Yel 9.23</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 1:31">1Ko 1.31</ref></char></note>.» <verse eid="2CO 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 10:18" />Mu mbuli, muutu wu bubaasilasa, a ni wu ubaasilasa nde mwakulu ve, ka ni nde wuuna wu Pfumu ubaabula mabyoho.<verse eid="2CO 10:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="2CO 11" />
  <para style="s1">Pahuli li mu ukebese libundu la Koliito mu biluumbi bi mapfuta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 11:1" />O! Tso benu luutwala ukuunda mwana a ladi la me! Eeye, kuundaani me mwana a hoole! <verse eid="2CO 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 11:2" />Me ndi na likwabi mu benu, mu likwabi li lili mu umata huli Nzambi: me atsa benu lahi li ukwelese benu huli mufudu makwele ndulu mumosi, ni Kristo. Na me tondi umweese benu huli nde we nuumba wa ngidi. <verse eid="2CO 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 11:3" />Ka, we bu Eva haadungi mu dyeele la taadi, me ndi na boomo ti matsimi ma benu a madunga, mu uveleba bangetetee na ba batsyeme mu Kristo<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11.3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 3:1-6">Mba 3.1-6</ref>,<ref loc="GEN 3:13">13</ref></char></note>. <verse eid="2CO 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 11:4" />Mu mbuli, benu lili mu ukuunda ti, muutu ayabisa benu Yisu mukima wu asobohono na wu bisu laayabisi benu. Buuve, benu laamiivangama mu usiinga livupu na ndongisili, bi byaasobohono na Livupu la Nzambi buuve na Musamu wu Mubwe, bi benu laayaki huli bisu!<verse eid="2CO 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 11:5" />Hwande, baatu ba bali mu umonehele ti bo «biluumbi bya manayee», me a handi mu umono mu ki lo byo byaavyohelele me ve. <verse eid="2CO 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 11:6" />Mu mbuli, me a haandeenge limi mu utoyo ve, ka uto ti mu nzaabili ya Nzambi, benu a luuto na me ve! Ŋa hati la benu, bisu likamwese benu ifwaani paayalala pasi taangu, mu pasi musamu.<verse eid="2CO 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 11:7" />Ŋa me anzabisi benu Musamu wu Mubwe wa Nzambi, me anzabisi benu nde mu bungodu. Me atondi ukulamana, mana benu lisyenoho. Kaahu bubi bu me atsiidi buuna? <verse eid="2CO 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 11:8" />Me apuuli mabundu makima na uyaka likumbasa la mbongo mu ukumbasa benu. <verse eid="2CO 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 11:9" />Na ŋa me ambeedi huli benu, me a haambeedi mupfuna a muutu tso mumosi mu benu ve, ŋa me akakeehele mu pasi isiha. Mu tooni ati, baana ba ngu ba baamati hu Masedonya, baabehili me byosi bi me ambeedi na byo nzala. Me a haatoondi uba mupfuna a benu mu pasi musamu ve, na me ukwada mu uveleba mupfuna huli benu. <verse eid="2CO 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 11:10" />Mu imbuli hya Kristo hi hili mu me, me miindeele lo: muutu tso mumosi a huukondosono me unyemele dyambu mo liina mu Akayi yoosi ve. <verse eid="2CO 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 11:11" />Mu hima me ndeeli buuna? Mu tooni a bu me apeletondo benu? Nzambi nde mwakulu asinzayaaba ti me atondo benu!<verse eid="2CO 11:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 11:12" />Me ukaakwada mu uvaanga mambu ma me ndi mu upaanga lolo yiniiyi, mu umaasa mapalulu moosi huli baatu ba bali mu usa nyeme ti, bisu boosi tsiitsa lili. <verse eid="2CO 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 11:13" />Mu mbuli, baatu mo baana biluumbi bi mapfuta bili. Bo bapfuti ba baatu mu mbongo, ba bali mu ulwata iyunga hi biluumbi bya Kristo. <verse eid="2CO 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 11:14" />Wuuna a hali musamu wa kimuhili ve, mu tooni ati, Saatana nde mwakulu ubaalwata iyunga hya pofi wu liyalala mu udungasa baatu. <verse eid="2CO 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 11:15" />Buuna, liina a luukimusa benu ve. Basalili ba Saatana kaka, bali mu ulwata iyunga hi basalili ba Nzambi wa tsiitsa. Ka bo buubaha tsukusu yi yaahwama na mavaanga ma bo.<verse eid="2CO 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mapasi ma Pahuli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 11:16" />Me mbwendeele lo: nyaha muutu tso mumosi aveletsima ti, me iyahudi ndi. Tso a buuna ve, siingaani me we iyahudi, mana me kaka tsa mwana a nyeme. <verse eid="2CO 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 11:17" />Mu mbuli, mu li litali musamu nyeme a me, me ndi mu utoyo we itsuudu, ka a we bu Pfumu Yisu akiitoyo ve. <verse eid="2CO 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 11:18" />Ka bu baatu ba balahi bali mu usa nyeme mu matooni ma imuutu, buuna me kaka utsa nyeme. <verse eid="2CO 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CO 11:19" />Benu ba lili bangeele, benu lili mu ukuunda biyahudi na bunyanga bwosi! <verse eid="2CO 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CO 11:20" />Benu lili mu ukuunda ti bakitusa benu we baviha, ti bataana busina bwa benu, ti bapatula mbahili a benu, ti batala benu mu talili yi isaayi, ti batete benu mu mbalanga. <verse eid="2CO 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CO 11:21" />Ki pila a tsonyi mu uleele lo: bisu kaahu laafulala butsatsambi? Ni buuna benu litsimi?</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CO 11:21">Hwande, tso bakima babili usa nyeme, me kaka utoyo we nga a ladi, me unzyehele usa nyeme. <verse eid="2CO 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CO 11:22" />Bo bisu Ebeleho bali? A me kaka musi Ebeleho. Bo bisu Isereli bali? A me kaka musi Isereli. Bo ba imbisa hya Abrahami bali? A me kaka wu imbisa hya Abrahami. <verse eid="2CO 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CO 11:23" />Bo Kristo bali mu usalila? Buuna, me utoyo we nga a ladi — me afulala bo — me miitsala bisalu bi binono ufulala bo. Me akoto bikondaayi taangu yoosi ufulala bo, baateti me ufulala bo, na taangu yoosi, me ambeedi bebele na lipfu ufulala bo. <verse eid="2CO 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CO 11:24" />Me anzaki huli Bayudaayo maku matatu ma bikooti, bikooti ipfwa (39)<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11.24</char><char style="fq" closed="false">matatu ma bikooti, bikooti ipfwa</char><char style="ft" closed="false">mabuuku ma tsikulu mali mu uleele maku mana, umaasa imosi: a baakiibila uvyoso maku mana ma bikooti ve we bu baasonehe mu </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="DEU 25:3">Pfu 25.3</ref></char>.</note>, nzaka taanu. <verse eid="2CO 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2CO 11:25" />Bisu Looma baateti me bikooti tete tatu. Baalangi me mamanya langa limosi mu uduba me. Me andyaami mu likuumbi ndyaama tatu, me apyoosi ilumbu imosi na butsuhu bumosi wu aleengoho mu mubu. <verse eid="2CO 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2CO 11:26" />Mu midyenge mya me mi milahi, me ambwani na bikahu bi banzali ba baaluula, buuve bi bataani, bikahu bya baatu ba buli la me, buuve bikahu bi bangoyi. Me amba bebele na lipfu mu misyenge, mu makumu, mu mubu, bebele na lipfu ŋa hati la yuha baana ba ngu. <verse eid="2CO 11:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2CO 11:27" />Me ambwani bisalu bi binono na malobese ma manono. Taangu yoosi me ambeedi mutso biriimba. Me amoni nzala na peyu. Taangu yoosi me akandya ikaandi. Me akamono pasi mu piyu na mu vele li bikutu. <verse eid="2CO 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2CO 11:28" />Na, hwavele utoyo mu mikima-mikima, hi hili mu uleme ŋa yulu a me pasi ilumbu: ni mupfuna wu mabundu moosi. <verse eid="2CO 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2CO 11:29" />Tso muutu li wu akolo, me kaka ndi mu umono ikolili na nde. Tso muutu bwiidi mu masumu, me ndi mu umono pasi yi yaafulala mu mutima a me.<verse eid="2CO 11:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="2CO 11:30" />Tso hu li ti usa nyeme, ni mu ikolili hya me, me utsa nyeme. <verse eid="2CO 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2CO 11:31" />Nzambi wu li Taata a Pfumu a bisu Yisu — nyaha bayuusa nde mu bilima na bilima — nde yaabi ti me a handi mu upfuta ve. <verse eid="2CO 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="2CO 11:32" />Ŋa me ambeedi hu musyenge a Damaseko, mukuutu wu akasalila mutumi Aretaasi, asuusi bakeedi ba nde mu ukeelese minywa mya nzo mi musyenge, mu tooni ukaanga me. <verse eid="2CO 11:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2CO 11:33" />Ka baapalisi me mu luta li ibaha hi musyenge, mutso a poonzi na baakulimisi me hu mbadi, na ni buuna me apfuuhi ŋa myoho mya nde<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11.33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 9:23-25">Mav 9.23-25</ref></char></note>.<verse eid="2CO 11:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="2CO 12" />
  <para style="s1">Bimono-miisu na manzabisili bya Pahuli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 12:1" />Buuna me apfwana ubwesa nyeme! Tso bu yo yaavele na tsoongo. Bunuubu me utoyo mu bimono-miisu na manzabisili ma Pfumu haava me. <verse eid="2CO 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 12:2" />Me nzaabi wa mukristo mumosi, humiivyoho bilima kuumi na bina, wu Nzambi haasyenuli natee hu mayulu ma matatu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12.2 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">mayulu ma matatu </char><char style="ft" closed="false">huli Bayudaayo, mayulu ma matatu mbindulili ni ti, hu Nzambi ali mu utsahala, hu mbisa mayidu.</char></note> — me a hanzaabi ve tso mbuli mu nyutu Nzambi asyenuli nde, buuve ti nde ayaki imono-miisu, wu yaabi ndulu Nzambi — <verse eid="2CO 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 12:3" />eeye, me nzaabi ti muutu mo wuuna, Nzambi asyenuli nde natee hu paradiso<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12.3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 23:43">Luk 23.43</ref></char></note>. Me mbwepfutahala lo, me a hanzaabi ve tso mbuli mu nyutu Nzambi asyenuli nde, buuve ti nde ayaki imono-miisu, wu yaabi ndulu Nzambi. <verse eid="2CO 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 12:4" />Nzambi asyenuli muutu mo wuuna natee hu paradiso. Na nde ayuhi mambu ma buuveletwala uyaabisa mu munywa a muutu, ma baaveleva muswa huli muutu mu ubweleele. <verse eid="2CO 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 12:5" />Tso me tsiidi nyeme mu muutu mo wuuna, a mu tooni a bu me ndi na nyeme mu me mwakulu ve. A buuna ve: me bikolili bya me ndi mu nyemele. <verse eid="2CO 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 12:6" />Me kini akatondo usa nyeme, me a haakiimba na mbele ve, mu tooni ati me imbuli me ndi mu undeele. Ka me ndi mu umbisa ubwesa nyeme, mu boomo bwa ti, biyuusili bi baatu bali mu uyuusa me, a biba bi byatengeme na bi mapfuta. Ka byo byafwana ukwelene na bi bo bali mu umono me mu usa na uleele.<verse eid="2CO 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 12:7" />Buuna, me mu uveleluula mu nyeme, mu manzabisili ma kimuhili ma me anzaki, baatsoki me isyesyele mu linyutu. Ni iluumbi hya Saatana hi baatsindihi mu utete me mu ukondosono me uluula mu nyeme. <verse eid="2CO 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 12:8" />Me atsambili huli Pfumu tsambila tatu, mu ufuuhasa me mu pasi mo yiina. <verse eid="2CO 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 12:9" />Nde afutili me: «Hyese hya me hyaakuha mu we! Matwala ma me ubaamonehele mutso ikolili.» Ni mu buuna, me tondi usa nyeme mu bikolili bya me, mana matwala ma Kristo makwilala mu me. <verse eid="2CO 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 12:10" />Ni mu buuna, me ndi na kinya mu bikolili, mu bituhi, mu mapasi, mu kwamisa, mu mbingisili na mu minyoongo bi me ndi mu ukuunda mu tooni a Kristo. Mu tooni ati, mu tangu yi me ndi wu akolo, ni mu tangu mo yiina me ndi na mifudi.<verse eid="2CO 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Makebisili ma Pahuli huli bisu Koliito</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 12:11" />Me ndi mu utoyo we nga a ladi, ka ni benu lili mu utsukamasa me mu lo. Benu ti ni ba likiibaasilasa me. Mu tooni ati, tso me peli muutu wa tsoongo, biluumbi bya benu yuha «bya manayee», a byafulala me ve. <verse eid="2CO 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 12:12" />Mavaanga ma mali mu umwese ti me iluumbi, maamonihili ŋa hati la benu mu mukonono wu asupaha: me atsiidi biliimbu bya kimuhili, bipadi na bimangu bi matwala. <verse eid="2CO 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 12:13" />Ki dyambu me apaangi mu mabundu makima, li me apelipaanga huli benu? Bu me apelindya mbongo a benu? Ubaamono ti me atsiidi bubi mu dyambu mo liina, saani me kolo-kolo.<verse eid="2CO 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 12:14" />Me amiipangama mu uya huli benu mu ya la tatu, na me a umba mupfuna huli benu ve. Me benu ndi mu utsaha, a mbongo a benu ve. Mu mbuli, a ni baana bubaakumbasa babuti ba bo mu mbongo ve, ka ni babuti baafwana ubaakumbasa baana ba bo mu mbongo. <verse eid="2CO 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 12:15" />Ka uto ti mu me, me ndi na kinya yi yaafulala mu uva byosi bi me ndi na byo huli benu, na uvaanga moosi ma me tondi mu libwe li mivumu mya benu. Tso me pfulitondo benu, buni benu luutondo me ndulu hoole?<verse eid="2CO 12:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 12:16" />Benu lafwana usilasa ti me a haambeedi mupfuna mu benu ve. Ka baatu buuleele ti me mupfuti, wu li mu usoho benu. <verse eid="2CO 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 12:17" />Me anzuya benu mu muutu mumosi mu ba me atsindaha huli benu? <verse eid="2CO 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 12:18" />Me apondo huli Tiite mu uyene huli benu, na me atsindaha benu mwana a ngu wu benu liyaabi, nzila mosi na Tiite. Tiite benu haayuya? Bisu a nde baboole a laakasala mu matsimi mamosi, na a laakaduukala nzila mosi ve?<verse eid="2CO 12:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CO 12:19" />Umata mwana a taangu, peleve benu lili mu utsima ti, bisu linyutu lili mu ukala ŋa busu bwa benu. Naana! Bisu lili mu utoyo itwadi na Kristo ŋa busu bwa Nzambi. Na bisu lili mu uleele benu mambu mo maana moosi, bambaahi ba litondo, mu ukulasa benu mu imiinu. <verse eid="2CO 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CO 12:20" />Me ndi na boomo ti taangu yi me unza huli benu, me pelenzaambiisa benu we bu me katondo, na me mba we bu benu likatondo. Me ndi kaka na boomo bu uyabiisa mitsotso na likwabi, kesi na nyengi, uyambila bubi mu bana na makusa, nyeme na hyayuhu. <verse eid="2CO 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CO 12:21" />Me ndi na boomo ti, ŋa me umbwenzaamono benu, Nzambi a me a hamweese me tsonyi mu tooni a benu. Me ndi na boomo kaka ti, me ndila mu tooni a baatu ba balahi ba bali mu uhwada mu usa masumu we hutsomi. Peleve bo a baasobo mbiili a bo ya mbiindu ve, yi bumbembo na mavaanga ma tsonyi ma bo baakasalila.<verse eid="2CO 12:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="2CO 13" />
  <para style="s1">Mabwehe ma tsyelele</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 13:1" />Liniili ka ni ya li matatu me ndi mu unza huli benu. We bu baasonehe: «Kesili a pasi dyambu ubaavolo, hu mbisa imbangi hya baatu boole buuve batatu<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13.1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 19:15">Pfu 19.15</ref></char></note>.» <verse eid="2CO 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 13:2" />Me na kebisili yi uva huli ba baasumihi hutsomi na huli bakima boosi. Me amiikwakebese bo mu mudyenge a me wa myole huli benu. Na lolo mo yiniiyi, me tondi ubwefutahala yo bu me apele ŋa hati la benu. Ŋa me umbwenzaapfutaha mu umono benu, me a upeengolo muutu tso mumosi ve. <verse eid="2CO 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 13:3" />Mu mbuli, benu lili mu usaha iliimbu hi Kristo ali mu utoyo mu me. Nde wu avelekolo ŋa hati la benu, ka nde li mu umweese matwala ma nde ŋa hati la benu. <verse eid="2CO 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 13:4" />Mu mbuli, ŋa baakomini Kristo ŋa kuruwa, nde aba wu akolo, ka lolo yiniiyi, mu matwala ma Nzambi, nde li moonyi. Ni bumosi kaka, mu itwadi hya bisu na nde, bisu lili ba laakolo. Ka mu matwala ma Nzambi, bisu luuba moonyi mu nde, mu libwe la benu.<verse eid="2CO 13:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 13:5" />Yebaani mitima mya benu, na kengesaani matsimi ma benu, mu umono tso benu lili mu udyaata mu imiinu. Benu a laayaaba ve ti Yisu Kristo li ŋa hati la benu? Umono ti a buuna ve, kengisili a matsimi huli benu, yaabiika. <verse eid="2CO 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 13:6" />Ka me tsimi ti, benu luuyaaba ti bisu laabiinga mu isalu huli benu. <verse eid="2CO 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 13:7" />Bisu lili mu usambila Nzambi, mana benu livelevaanga lilibi tso limosi. Bisu a litondi umweese ve ti bisu laamiibiinga, ka bisu litondi ti benu libaavaanga ma mabwe, tso bu bo bali mu urokolo bisu. <verse eid="2CO 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 13:8" />Mu tooni ati, bisu utwala usa pasi isiha, hi hyutelemene imbuli hya Nzambi ve. Bisu utwala usala ndulu mu imbuli. <verse eid="2CO 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 13:9" />Bisu ubaamono kinya, ŋa bisu lili ba laakolo, tso ni mbuli benu lili na mifudi. Maana ni ma bisu libaavondo mu masambulu: ti benu likituha baatu ba baasupaha mu imiinu. <verse eid="2CO 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 13:10" />Ni mu buuna, me ndi mu utsonehele benu maniima moosi, tso bu me kini lala na benu, mana, mu taangu yi me umba itwadi na benu, me peletsyembe benu na bunono mu lituma li Pfumu haava me. Lituma li luuveletsala libundu la benu, ka li luukulasa lo.<verse eid="2CO 13:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 13:11" />Na bunuubu, baana ba ngu, baani mu kinya. Sahaani uba baatu ba baasupaha mu imiinu, hwadasanaani, baani matsimi mamosi, baani mu hyenze. Buuna Nzambi yi litondo na ya hyenze uba na benu!<verse eid="2CO 13:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 13:12" />Vanasanaani mabwehe mu ubumbasana hwa baana ba ngu ba litondo.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CO 13:12">Bangidi mu Kristo bamiitsindaha benu mabwehe.<verse eid="2CO 13:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 13:13" />Nyaha lisyeme la Pfumu a bisu Yisu Kristo, litondo la Nzambi, na itwadi hi Livupu la Ngidi, biba na benu boosi!<verse eid="2CO 13:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 13" />
</usx>